From ee93ad1bcbc9c146697c71b7edd1e9823e0a5c28 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Duron27 <duron27@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:16:03 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Generic main menu button hook: ui.addMainMenuButton; the
 multiplayer button is the mod's own

- ui.addMainMenuButton{ id, normal, highlighted, pushed, after } (menu scripts): an extra button on the main menu, placed
  after the button it names (before Options by default). A click calls onMainMenuButton(id). Built-in ids are refused.
- mainmenu.cpp no longer knows about multiplayer: its buttons come from what the scripts registered
- menu.lua registers the Multiplayer button; its three textures moved from files/data to multiplayer/mod/textures
- TODO.md: item done

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
