    - Core (small, built in): `netlib`, session/handshake, the pack manager, an extension bus.
    - Packs: avatars + animation (`remote`), party/chat UI (`player`), `trade`, `shots`, `proxies` (shared fights), ailments,
diff --git a/multiplayer/mod/scripts/mp/menu.lua b/multiplayer/mod/scripts/mp/menu.lua
